-- game.ReplicatedStorage.Client.React.Interfaces.HelpInterface.TabContents.PvE
return "<h>Start a Run</h>\n1. Open <t>Modes</t>, pick <t>PvE</t>, then step on a lobby pad.\n2. The host picks a mission, grade and team size. Choose your character before leaving; it stays locked for the run.\n\n<h>Survive + Upgrade</h>\n- Pick <t>augment cards</t> between waves. Their boosts last for that run.\n{image:AugmentCards}\n- Revive before the next wave. Everyone down ends the run.\n- Waves earn <t>PvE Coins</t>. Spend them at the lobby\'s Upgrade Vendor for permanent upgrades.\n{image:PvECoins}\n- Stay alive at wave end to earn crates. Open them from <t>Loot</t>.\n- Clears from Grade 1 up can drop a <t>Cursed Hourglass</t>. Use it in <t>Loot</t> to take 30 minutes off every crate timer.\n\n<h>Harder Runs</h>\n- Grades open one at a time. Clear a grade while you\'re still standing to open the next.\n- Clear <t>Special Grade</t> to unlock <t>Challenge</t> and <t>HARDCORE</t>.\n- <t>Challenge:</t> tougher enemies. No revives and no pickups.\n- <t>HARDCORE:</t> Grade 1 and up. No augment cards, revives or pickups, but 40% more wave coins, a bonus crate and more hourglasses. Clear Special Grade or Challenge mode with it on to earn the Veil Talisman.\n- A daily quest pays Points for your first HARDCORE clear each day to the character you cleared it with: 2 on Challenge, 1 otherwise.\n"











